        <Key ID="STR_ZTW_ApplyWeather">
            <Original>天气立即生效</Original>
            <English>Apply weather now</English>
            <Chinesesimp>天气立即生效</Chinesesimp>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_ZTW_ApplyWeatherTooltip">
            <Original>所有人（包括服务器）跳过剩下的天气渐变，马上到达目标天气，并刷新云层画面（会卡一下）。天气卡住不变、或者换成晴天后画面还是漆黑时用。</Original>
            <English>Everyone (including the server) skips the rest of the weather change, jumps straight to the target weather and refreshes the cloud rendering (brief hitch). Use it when the weather seems stuck, e.g. still pitch black after switching to clear.</English>
            <Chinesesimp>所有人（包括服务器）跳过剩下的天气渐变，马上到达目标天气，并刷新云层画面（会卡一下）。天气卡住不变、或者换成晴天后画面还是漆黑时用。</Chinesesimp>
        </Key>
