            <Original>现实时间里这次过渡用多少秒（1-600）。跳 12 小时用 20 秒，太阳就会在 20 秒内平滑地走过去。</Original>
            <English>Real seconds the transition takes (1-600). Skipping 12 hours over 20 s moves the sun smoothly across the sky in 20 s.</English>
